      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Plasma sorption was performed in patients with Functional Classes III-IV angina pectoris by using the sorbent FAS. A positive clinical effect was achieved in 81%. There was a significant reduction in the levels of total cholesterol and low density lipoprotein cholesterol. The concentration of high density lipoprotein cholesterol remained unchanged."},
